  "_notes": [
    "bay: the card asks for three foam dummies to warm up the trigger on. No dummy is a placeable thing in the blockout format (only waves spawn Foamers, and a wave would lock the bay), so the three dummies are small voxel foam-white pieces at x -5.5, 0 and 6, z -7 to -9: they carve like any cover, go down in a few darts and cannot shoot back.",
    "explore-1: the S1 vent is [Paul] and not built; the foam-yellow marking at [5, -30] in the room's south-west corner marks its empty spot."
  ]
